cks, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'此站点上使用的所有区域设置（站点区域设置、已安装的语言包、用户区域设置，以及您手动添加的任何区域设置）。所有区域设置均一视同仁。','Excluded'=>'已排除','Files with other names or extensions are not included, nor are the uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules and languages folders, hidden files, or files whose names match common secrets (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key). Code files can still contain text or data you would not want to share; check them if you are unsure. The service removes the same kinds of files again on arrival.'=>'其他名称或扩展名的文件不会包含在内，uploads、cache、logs、backup、data、vendor、node_modules 和 languages 文件夹、隐藏文件，以及名称符合常见机密文件特征的文件（wp-config*、.env*、*.sql、*.log、*.pem、*.key）也不会包含。代码文件中仍可能包含您不想分享的文本或数据；如有疑虑，请检查这些文件。服务在收到文件后会再次移除同类文件。','Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site.'=>'为您站点上已安装的插件和主题补全缺失的翻译。','Free'=>'免费','Free-plan slots'=>'免费方案名额','General'=>'常规','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'如果开启此项，卸载时还会清除此站点的身份信息。之后将无法自动恢复绑定到此站点的付费许可证；您需要通过 %s 联系 Babilim 支持才能找回。','Included'=>'已包含','Included in index'=>'已纳入索引','Install available translations automatically'=>'自动安装可用的翻译','Installed'=>'已安装','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'已安装的翻译会保留，但不会再执行检查或下载。','Installed · %s'=>'已安装 · %s','Installed · built for %1$s, this site has %2$s'=>'已安装 · 适用于 %1$s，此站点为 %2$s','Installed · built for %s'=>'已安装 · 适用于 %s','Installed · built for %s, new version failed'=>'已安装 · 适用于 %s，新版本失败','Installed · built for %s, new version scheduled'=>'已安装 · 针对 %s 构建，新版本已排程','Installed · built for %s, translating the new version…'=>'已安装 · 适用于 %s，正在翻译新版本…','Installed · built for %s; this plugin or theme is no longer covered by the site\'s service plan'=>'已安装 · 适用于 %s；此插件或主题已不