d_id:%s','Not covered by the free service plan'=>'不在免费服务方案涵盖范围内','Not installed'=>'未安装','Not registered yet'=>'尚未注册','Not supported'=>'不支持','Not verified'=>'未验证','Note (optional)'=>'备注（可选）','Nothing to choose.'=>'没有可选择的内容。','Nothing to confirm.'=>'没有需要确认的内容。','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'默认关闭：删除插件时会保留此站点的标识，以便重新安装后可以继续使用。','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'一个或多个已提供的文件与清单不再一致。','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'此站点的一次性购买：%1$s %2$s。包含今后所有的翻译更新。付款由 Paddle 在新标签页中处理。','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'只有网络管理员才能执行此操作，因为这会更改此网络中所有站点共享的翻译文件。','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'只能打包插件和主题。','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in that component\'s main folder, as a zip, after files that match common secrets are left out.'=>'仅当您确认上传不在 WordPress.org 上的插件或主题时：该组件中的所有 .php 和 .js 文件、所有 block.json 文件，以及其主文件夹中的 readme.txt、readme.md、style.css 和 theme.json，会在排除符合常见机密特征的文件后以 zip 形式上传。','Open Babilim settings'=>'打开 Babilim 设置','Original language'=>'原始语言','Original string'=>'原始字符串','Paid'=>'付费','Partner'=>'合作伙伴','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'请检查您的站点是否可从互联网访问，然后重试。','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'请为此报告选择一个类别。','Plugin'=>'插件','Plugin · %s'=>'插件 · %s','Plugins'=>'插件','Preview'=>'预览','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'购买已恢复。此站点现已获得许可。','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'重新解析得到的条目数与构建的索引不一致。','Re-verify'=>'重新验证','Rebuild index now'=>'立即重建索引','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'拒绝写入 Babilim 语言文件目录之外的位置。','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'注册响应缺少必需的字段。','Registration restarted.'=>'已重新开始注册。','Remove'=>'移除','Remove everything Babilim installed'=>'删除 Babilim 安装的所有内容','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'要删除 Babilim 安装的所有内容吗？这将删除它为此站点上所有插件和主题安装的全部语言文件。','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'要从此站点中移除 %1$s 的 %2$s 翻译吗？','Removed %d installed component.'=>'已移除 %d 个已安装的组件。','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'完整性检查失败后已删除','Removed.'=>'已移除。','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'删除 Babilim 为此站点上所有插件和主题安装的全部语言文件。','Report a problem'=>'报告问题','Report translation'=>'报告翻译问题','Request newer translation'=>'请求更新的翻译','Request translation'=>'请求翻译','Requestable'=>'可请求','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site (the limit is %1$d for themes and %2$d for plugins), unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'请求翻译会使此插件或主题占用此站点免费服务方案的一个名额（主题上限为 %1$d 个，插件上限为 %2$d 个），已占用的除外。名额一旦占用便会保持占用，翻译失败也不会释放名额。','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site, unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'请求翻译会使此插件或主题占用此站点免费服务方案的一个名额，已占用的除外。名额一旦占用便会保持占用，翻译失败也不会释放名额。','Requesting…'=>'正在请求…','Restart registration'=>'重新开始注册','Restore code'=>'恢复代码','Restore purchase'=>'恢复购买','Retry request'=>'重试请求','Roll back'=>'回滚','Roll back and report'=>'回滚并报告','Roll back and send report'=>'回滚并发送报告','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'要将 %1$s 的 %2$s 翻译回滚到上一个构建版本吗？','Rolled back and reported.'=>'已回滚并报告。','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'已回滚到上一个构建版本。','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'已回滚，但无法发送报告：%s','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'回滚将覆盖“%1$s”（%2$s），该文件当前正为另一个已安装的组件（%3$s）提供服务；未做任何更改。','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'轮换令牌响应缺少 site_token。','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'已排程，等待处理','Search'=>'搜索','Search components'=>'搜索组件','Search the installed translations'=>'搜索已安装的翻译','Select all'=>'全选','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'请减少所选组件：每次运行最多 %1$d 项操作（您选择了 %2$d 项）。','Send report'=>'发送报告','Service plan'=>'服务方案','Settings'=>'设置','Share error reports'=>'分享错误报告','Share this report'=>'分享此报告','Show a new restore code'=>'显示新的恢复代码','Show the "Report translation" entry in the admin toolbar'=>'在管理工具栏中显示“报告翻译问题”入口','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'此组件的部分文本由其作者硬编码，无法通过语言包翻译。','Status'=>'状态','Status unknown'=>'状态未知','String context'=>'字符串上下文','Suggested translation'=>'建议的翻译','Supplementary translation index'=>'补充翻译索引','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'补充翻译索引已重建。','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'补充翻译维护','Supplementary translations'=>'补充翻译','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'清理已中止，未产生任何孤立项：%s。','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'清理完成：已删除 %d 个文件。','Sweep now'=>'立即清理','Sync complete.'=>'同步完成。','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'谢谢。您的报告已发送。','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'该组件未安装在此站点上，因此无法为其请求翻译。','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'这看起来不像恢复代码。','That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved.'=>'这不是有效的 WordPress 语言区域代码。未保存任何内容。','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'这不是有效的构建标识符。','That upload screen was out of date: a different upload has been prepared since. Nothing was sent. Review the current one from the Translations list.'=>'该上传界面已过期：此后已准备了另一次上传。未发送任何内容。请从翻译列表中查看当前的上传。','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'无法在翻译索引中记录此更改，请重试。','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'清理已执行，但其部分更改未能记录到翻译索引中；下次清理将重试。','The component has no files that can be uploaded.'=>'该组件没有可上传的文件。','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'该组件不在插件或主题目录内。','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'未找到该组件的主文件。','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'下载响应中缺少可用的位置。','The entry opens a panel to search the translations Babilim installed on this site and report one of them.'=>'该入口会打开一个面板，您可以在其中搜索 Babilim 在此站点上安装的翻译，并报告其中某一条翻译的问题。','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'字段“%1$s”过长：它有 %2$d 个字符，而上限为 %3$d。未发送任何内容，请缩短后重试。','The free service plan gives each site a limited number of slots for plugins and themes; the slots in use are shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'免费服务方案为每个站点提供数量有限的插件和主题名额；启用 Babilim 后，已使用的名额会显示在设置中。','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'给定的域“%1$s”既不匹配包清单自身的 slug“%2$s”，也不匹配其 text_domain“%3$s”。','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'已重建“%s”的合并索引，但翻译索引无法记录该操作；下次重建时将重试。','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'原始文本及据此生成的翻译将提供给安装相同版本的其他站点。','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'该包未声明主翻译文件。','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'该包中没有适用于其自身文本域的 %s。','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'包清单的类型“%1$s”与请求的类型“%2$s”不一致。','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'该包未生成可供使用的主翻译文件。','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'该包的文本域“%1$s”与此站点上该组件的文本域（“%2$s”）不一致，因此未安装。','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'无法读取已打包的组件。','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'注册质询的格式不符合预期。','The report could not be sent.'=>'无法发送报告。','The search could not be completed.'=>'无法完成搜索。','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'服务要求此站点在再次同步之前等待。','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'服务无法访问您的站点。可能是防火墙、安全插件或主机规则拦截了该请求；请允许对 /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge 的请求。','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'服务提供的上传方案不完整。','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'文本域“%1$s”（%2$s）已为另一个已安装的组件（%3$s）提供服务；未安装任何内容。','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'上传的内容会一直保留，直到您要求 Babilim 将其删除。','Theme'=>'主题','Theme · %s'=>'主题 · %s','Themes'=>'主题','There is no upload in progress.'=>'没有正在进行的上传。','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'没有等待确认的上传。','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'这些是此站点使用的语言。您可以在 %s 中更改。','These fields will be sent:'=>'将发送以下字段：','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'此站点当前不识别该组件/语言区域的这个构建版本。','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'该组件未声明版本号，因此无法为其请求翻译。','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'此组件大于服务所接受的大小，因此无法上传。','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'此组件已上传过。Babilim 正在检查。','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'该组件的版本号超过 %d 个字符，Babilim 无法处理，因此无法为其请求翻译。','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'此操作将签发新的恢复代码，之前的恢复代码将失效。是否继续？','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'此网络的站点过多，无法逐一检查，其中部分站点可能被设置为在删除插件时清除其 Babilim 身份标识。届时附属于此类站点的付费许可证将无法自动恢复，您需要通过 %s 联系 Babilim 支持。若要保留身份标识，请点击“取消”，在每个站点的 Babilim 设置中取消勾选“卸载时删除所有 Babilim 数据”，然后重新停用。仍要停用吗？','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'此插件自身的版本，以便在版本过旧而无法通信时，服务可以提示您更新。','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'此报告未指明有效的插件或主题以及语言区域。','This report does not name an installed string.'=>'此报告未指明已安装的字符串。','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'此报告缺少可供报告的有效构建版本。','This report will be posted publicly on GitHub and may be kept by third parties.'=>'此报告将公开发布在 GitHub 上，并可能被第三方保留。','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'此站点无法识别该恢复代码。','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'此站点已有一个有效的注册，但已无法自动恢复。','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'此站点共有 %1$d 个组件，涉及 %2$d 种语言，需要 %3$d 个检查批次；Babilim 每次运行最多可处理 %4$d 个。请在设置中减少托管的语言，或停用未使用的插件和主题，然后立即再次点击“检查”。','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'此站点没有可显示恢复代码的购买记录。','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'此站点已获得许可。请重新加载页面。','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'此站点尚未在 Babilim 注册。','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'此站点超出了服务单次同步可接受的规模，因此部分项目被略过：%1$d 个组件和 %2$d 种区域设置。','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'此站点属于多站点网络，不会自动安装新的翻译。已安装的翻译仍会更新。','This site is verified.'=>'此站点已通过验证。','This site must be verified first.'=>'必须先验证此站点。','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'此站点的 URL，以便服务验证您拥有该站点。','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'此站点的地址过长，Babilim 无法注册。','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'此站点配置的区域设置。','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'此站点的区域代码不是 Babilim 可以注册的代码。','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'无法从此站点报告此字符串。','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'此字符串不在此站点已安装的翻译中。请重新搜索并从列表中选择。','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'此翻译在您搜索之后已更新。请重新搜索并从新列表中选择该字符串。','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'要翻译此组件，Babilim 需要其源代码。','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'尝试次数过多。请明天再试。','Too many reports today. Try again tomorrow.'=>'今天的报告次数过多。请明天再试。','Too many requests.'=>'请求过多。','Toolbar'=>'工具栏','Translating…'=>'正在翻译…','Translation does not load'=>'翻译未加载','Translation failed'=>'翻译失败','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'您放在 %s 中的翻译文件始终优先于 Babilim 的翻译文件。除非您取消勾选此项，否则这些文件会一直保留。','Translation requested.'=>'已请求翻译。','Translations'=>'翻译','Type'=>'类型','Type at least 2 characters to search.'=>'输入至少 2 个字符即可搜索。','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'意外的 HTTP %d 响应。','Uninstall'=>'卸载','Unknown kind: %s'=>'未知类型：%s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'不安全的域：%s','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'不安全的区域设置：%s','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'不安全的 slug:%s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'不安全的 text_domain:%s','Update'=>'更新','Update available'=>'有可用更新','Updates'=>'更新','Updating…'=>'正在更新…','Upgrade this site'=>'升级此站点','Upload and request'=>'上传并请求','Upload cancelled.'=>'上传已取消。','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'上传完成，已请求翻译。','Upload expired before it finished'=>'上传在完成前已过期','Upload in progress — continue or cancel'=>'上传进行中 — 继续或取消','Upload this component?'=>'上传此组件？','Upload was not accepted'=>'上传未被接受','Uploading'=>'正在上传','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'正在上传第 %1$d 部分，共 %2$d 部分…','Uploading…'=>'正在上传…','Verified'=>'已验证','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'验证响应缺少 site_token。','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'启用 Babilim 时会发送哪些内容','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'当 Babilim 内部出现故障时，向 Babilim 服务发送错误报告，以便将其作为公开问题发布到 GitHub。报告会以此站点的名义发送，并采用与发往 Babilim 服务的其他所有请求相同的身份验证。该服务只会把错误代码和版本信息作为公开问题发布到 GitHub；公开问题中不包含站点地址、内容或文件路径。默认关闭。','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'您在何处看到此内容（可选）','While this is on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'开启后，服务列为可用、且属于您所管理语言的翻译，将在每日两次同步时自动安装。','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Wrong for this context'=>'不适用于此语境','Wrong meaning'=>'意思错误','Wrong plural form'=>'复数形式错误','Wrong term'=>'术语错误','Yes'=>'是','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'您无权执行此操作。','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'您的 PHP 版本，用于确保兼容性。','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'您的 WordPress 版本，用于提供兼容的翻译文件。','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'您的新恢复代码：%s。请妥善保管——之前的代码已失效。','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'您的报告将由 AI 模型自动处理，并可能改进其他站点上的这条翻译。','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'您的站点已响应，但返回的内容不符合预期。REST API 可能被其他插件改写，或该端点被缓存；请将 /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge 排除在缓存和改写之外。','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'您的站点响应时间过长。请稍后重试，并检查您的主机是否过慢或负载过高。','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Zip 中没有 manifest.json。','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'zip 中缺少预期的默认文件：%s','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'zip 中缺少预期的文件：%s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json 的结构不符合预期','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'无法读取 _manifest.json:%s','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest 缺少“%s”或其无效。','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'expected_manifest 的“server_build_id”不是有效的构建 ID。','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'解析 _manifest.json 失败：%s','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'这将使 %2$d 个受管理组件中的 %1$d 个成为孤立项（超过一半）','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'这将使每个受管理的%1$s组件成为孤立项（%2$d 个中的 %2$d 个）','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的 l10n.php 条目数不匹配','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json 的“default_domain_entries”无效。','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json 的“default_domain_files”无效。','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'zip 中的 manifest.json 不是有效的 JSON。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少“%s”或其无效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少“build_no”或其无效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少“entries”或其无效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少“extra_domains”或其无效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少“files”或其无效。','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'manifest.json 的“%s”与预期值不一致。','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'manifest.json 的“contract”不是有效的版本字符串。','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'manifest.json 的“kind”（类型）必须为“plugin”或“theme”（主题）。','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'manifest.json 的“server_build_id”不是有效的构建 ID。','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'manifest.json 的“status”（状态）必须为“published”（已发布）。','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce 必须是十六进制字符串。','per day'=>'每天','rc_…'=>'rc_…','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的 sha256 不匹配','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'default/%s 的 sha256 不匹配','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'插件','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'主题','problem report categoryOther'=>'其他','translation statusAvailable'=>'可用','translation statusInstalled'=>'已安装','Babilim translation turned off.'=>'Babilim 翻译已关闭。','Stop using Babilim translation'=>'停止使用 Babilim 翻译','Use Babilim translation'=>'使用 Babilim 翻译','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the theme\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'要停止使用 %1$s（%2$s）的 Babilim 翻译吗？WordPress 将改用该主题自带的翻译或 WordPress.org 的翻译。您可以随时切换回来。','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the plugin\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'要停止使用 %1$s（%2$s）的 Babilim 翻译吗？WordPress 将改用该插件自带的翻译或 WordPress.org 的翻译。您可以随时切换回来。','Babilim – Auto-Translate Plugins & Themes'=>'Babilim – Auto-Translate Plugins & Themes','Enjoying Babilim? Please leave a rating on WordPress.org.'=>'喜欢 Babilim 吗？请在 WordPress.org 上给我们评分。','Rate Babilim'=>'为 Babilim 评分','Babilim translation bundled with the theme'=>'主题内置的 Babilim 翻译','Babilim translation bundled with the plugin'=>'插件内置的 Babilim 翻译','For every installed plugin and theme: its name (slug), version, text domain, whether it is listed on WordPress.org, the languages it already includes, and which of those bundled translations Babilim generated (language codes only). For each Babilim translation you have installed: which version it is, when it was last checked, and whether it passed its file check.'=>'对于每个已安装的插件和主题：其名称（别名）、版本、text domain、是否已在 WordPress.org 上架，其已包含的语言，以及这些内置翻译中哪些由 Babilim 生成（仅语言代码）。对于您已安装的每个 Babilim 翻译：其版本、上次检查时间，以及是否通过文件检查。']];